  "details": "Allow players to choose if they want their home instance to be invite, invite+, friends, friends+, or public  Additionally, allow players to choose the instance ID and nonce of their home instance so that two or more people can always spawn into the same instance together. I'm aware this is already possible through launch settings on steam, but it just loads the world after launch - hitting go home in game will only ever create a private instance.",
